  "body": "Positioned in a peaceful street within the sought-after Ara Hills community, this impressive residence delivers a perfect blend of space, functionality, and modern comfort. Designed with family living in mind, the home offers generous proportions, flexible layout, and quality finishes throughout.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the tranquility of surrounding nature while still being conveniently connected to everything you need.\r\n Key Features:\r\n\r\n* 6 generous bedrooms, ideal for large or extended families\r\n* Multiple bathrooms, including ensuites for added privacy and convenience\r\n* 3 spacious living areas, perfect for entertaining or relaxing\r\n* Modern kitchen with scullery, designed for both everyday living and hosting\r\n* Separate laundry for practicality\r\n* Double internal-access garage plus additional storage space\r\n* Great indoor-outdoor flow, ideal for family gatherings                                                                             \r\n\r\n Location Highlights:\r\n\r\nSituated just a short drive to Orewa Beach, local schools, shopping centres, and scenic walking and cycling tracks. Easy motorway access ensures a smooth commute both north and south.\r\n\r\nA fantastic opportunity to secure a substantial home in one of Upper Orewa's fastest-growing communities.",
